<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Titan raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Titan raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said Monday it upgraded Titan Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Raised 12-18 month target price to $8.75 per share, or 25 times 1998 earnings estimate of $0.35.</p>
<p>-- Cited heightened confidence in company's ability to accelerate earnings growth due to Alcatel contract win.</p>
<p>-- Said Titan's Q2 earnings of $0.05 per share, reported earlier today, were &quot;in line with our estimate.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/16 to six.</p>
</text>
